  "releaseNotes": "6.0.20: Production crash workflow. The `<DemeanorReport>` MSBuild property (on by default) emits `<assembly>.report.json` alongside your obfuscated build; pair it with `demeanor deobfuscate crash.log --report <assembly>.report.json` to read field crash traces in source-code terms — async / iterator state machines, lambda bodies, local functions, generics, and nested compiler-generated shapes all recover automatically. AI-assisted deobfuscation through any MCP-capable assistant — Enterprise. See https://www.wiseowlsoftware.com.",
